The bundled component presets of data/components/database/ (installed to share/QtRocket/components/database/) are
the openrocket-database (https://github.com/openrocket/openrocket-database), its 16 .orc files at its commit
1512874 as OpenRocket bundles them, unchanged: Copyright (C) 2014-2022 Dave Cook, Stephen J. Heilman and the other
